  ('fg-g01049', 'forest-governance', 'environment-sustainable-development', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In the context of the National Integrated Protected Areas System (NIPAS), which of the following is crucial for ensuring the sustainable development of a protected area that also supports local livelihoods?',
