  ('fg-g01050', 'forest-governance', 'environment-sustainable-development', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'Which of the following is a critical step in achieving sustainable forest management under the Philippine Master Plan for Forestry Development when considering indigenous peoples’ rights?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Granting exclusive logging rights to multinational companies"},{"id":"b","text":"Restricting access to forest resources for all indigenous communities"},{"id":"c","text":"Incorporating indigenous knowledge into forest management practices"},{"id":"d","text":"Prioritizing commercial logging over community-based initiatives"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01051', 'forest-governance', 'environment-sustainable-development', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'How does the integration of Payment for Ecosystem Services (PES) schemes contribute to sustainable development in forest management in the Philippines?',
