  ('fg-g01052', 'forest-governance', 'environment-sustainable-development', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In the context of the Philippine EIA system, which component is essential for ensuring that development projects align with the principles of sustainable development?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Rapid Environmental Assessment (REA)"},{"id":"b","text":"Environmental Audit (EA)"},{"id":"c","text":"Environmental Management Plan (EMP)"},{"id":"d","text":"Cumulative Impact Assessment (CIA)"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01053', 'forest-governance', 'environment-sustainable-development', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'Which of the following describes a challenge in aligning the National Greening Program (NGP) with sustainable development goals in the Philippines?',
