  ('fg-g01102', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'Which ethical consideration is crucial for foresters when conducting environmental impact assessments?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"To ensure assessments are completed as quickly as possible, regardless of accuracy."},{"id":"b","text":"To use biased data to support project approval."},{"id":"c","text":"To provide an objective analysis based on scientific evidence."},{"id":"d","text":"To prioritize the interests of the funding agency over environmental concerns."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01103', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'Under professional ethics, what should a forester do when they suspect illegal logging activities in their area of responsibility?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ignore it unless there is public outcry."},{"id":"b","text":"Conduct personal investigations without involving law enforcement."},{"id":"c","text":"Negotiate with the perpetrators to minimize impact."},{"id":"d","text":"Report the activities to the appropriate authorities."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01104', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'According to the Code of Ethics for Filipino Foresters, how should foresters manage the integration of indigenous knowledge in forest management?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"By disregarding indigenous knowledge as unscientific."},{"id":"b","text":"By using it only if it aligns with current scientific theories."},{"id":"c","text":"By keeping it separate from modern forest management practices."},{"id":"d","text":"By valuing and incorporating it respectfully into management plans."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01105', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'What ethical guideline should a forester follow to ensure fair decision-making processes within their team?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"To prioritize decisions that benefit the forester''s personal interests."},{"id":"b","text":"To involve all team members in the decision-making process and consider diverse perspectives."},{"id":"c","text":"To make decisions unilaterally to save time."},{"id":"d","text":"To defer all decisions to senior management without input from the team."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01106', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'In professional ethics, what should guide a forester''s actions when tasked with updating forest management plans?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"To prioritize the economic aspects over ecological balance."},{"id":"b","text":"To ensure the plans are based on the latest scientific research and community input."},{"id":"c","text":"To replicate the existing plans to avoid controversy."},{"id":"d","text":"To focus primarily on maximizing timber yields regardless of environmental impact."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01107', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'According to the Code of Ethics for Filipino Foresters, what is a forester''s main responsibility when utilizing forest resources?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Maximize economic gain."},{"id":"b","text":"Ensure sustainability and conservation."},{"id":"c","text":"Prioritize timber production."},{"id":"d","text":"Follow government directives without question."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01108', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'What is the primary ethical obligation of a forester when interacting with local communities as per professional ethics?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Enforce strict compliance with regulations."},{"id":"b","text":"Promote community participation and empowerment."},{"id":"c","text":"Limit community access to forest resources."},{"id":"d","text":"Prioritize commercial interests."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01109', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'In terms of professional ethics, what should guide a forester''s decision-making process in forest management?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Personal beliefs and values."},{"id":"b","text":"Pressure from political entities."},{"id":"c","text":"Historical practices."},{"id":"d","text":"Scientific evidence and community needs."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01110', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'What is a forester''s ethical responsibility when there are conflicting interests between conservation and development?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Seek a balanced approach considering both."},{"id":"b","text":"Support development over conservation."},{"id":"c","text":"Disregard development interests."},{"id":"d","text":"Ignore conservation concerns."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01111', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'Under professional ethics, how should a forester address reports of illegal logging in their area?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ignore the reports."},{"id":"b","text":"Handle the situation personally."},{"id":"c","text":"Investigate and report through proper channels."},{"id":"d","text":"Defer responsibility to local communities."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01112', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'What ethical principle is emphasized for foresters participating in research studies?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize funding over research integrity."},{"id":"b","text":"Focus on quantity of research output."},{"id":"c","text":"Ensure accuracy and transparency in findings."},{"id":"d","text":"Only publish favorable results."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01113', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'According to the Code of Ethics for Filipino Foresters, what is the role of a forester in educating the public about forest conservation?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Maintain secrecy of forest data."},{"id":"b","text":"Discourage public involvement."},{"id":"c","text":"Focus solely on academic circles."},{"id":"d","text":"Promote awareness and understanding."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01114', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'What is the ethical requirement for foresters when working with indigenous communities?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Overlook traditional practices."},{"id":"b","text":"Integrate and respect indigenous knowledge."},{"id":"c","text":"Enforce modern practices exclusively."},{"id":"d","text":"Minimize interactions with local communities."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01115', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'mock',
   'In the context of professional ethics, what should a forester do when they discover outdated forest management practices still in use?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Continue using them to maintain tradition."},{"id":"b","text":"Advocate for and implement updated practices."},{"id":"c","text":"Ignore the need for change."},{"id":"d","text":"Wait for official directives to change."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01116', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What ethical principle should guide a forester when making decisions that could impact both forest conservation and local community livelihoods?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize economic development over conservation."},{"id":"b","text":"Focus solely on the scientific research data."},{"id":"c","text":"Delegate decision-making to external stakeholders."},{"id":"d","text":"Balance conservation efforts with the needs of local communities."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01117', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'Which professional ethical guideline should a forester follow when dealing with intellectual property sourced from indigenous knowledge?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Assume all information is public domain and use it freely."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore traditional knowledge and use only modern techniques."},{"id":"c","text":"Seek informed consent and provide benefits sharing."},{"id":"d","text":"Delegate responsibility to a non-governmental organization."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01118', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'When faced with pressure from a logging company to prioritize timber extraction over conservation, what ethical action should a forester take?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Negotiate a compromise that maximizes profits."},{"id":"b","text":"Resign from the project to avoid conflict."},{"id":"c","text":"Stand by conservation principles and report undue pressure."},{"id":"d","text":"Accept the company''s proposal to avoid confrontation."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01119', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'In what manner should a forester ethically manage public consultations regarding a new forest management plan?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Limit consultations to stakeholders with economic interests."},{"id":"b","text":"Conduct consultations only with government representatives."},{"id":"c","text":"Ensure all affected parties, including marginalized groups, are heard."},{"id":"d","text":"Focus exclusively on academic experts'' opinions."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01120', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically address a situation where illegal wildlife trade is observed within a forest area they manage?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Report the activity to the relevant authorities immediately."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore it to maintain community relations."},{"id":"c","text":"Document it for personal records without taking further action."},{"id":"d","text":"Consult with local traders to find a compromise."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01121', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is an ethical requirement for foresters when they are offered gifts by stakeholders during fieldwork?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Accept gifts as a sign of good relationship."},{"id":"b","text":"Accept gifts only if they are of minimal value."},{"id":"c","text":"Accept gifts but report them to superiors."},{"id":"d","text":"Reject gifts to maintain impartiality and avoid conflicts of interest."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01122', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'When developing forest policies, what ethical approach should foresters take to integrate scientific research and traditional practices?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize scientific research over traditional practices."},{"id":"b","text":"Integrate both by evaluating the benefits and limitations of each."},{"id":"c","text":"Focus on traditional practices due to historical significance."},{"id":"d","text":"Exclude scientific research to favor local customs entirely."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01123', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What ethical practice should a forester follow when conducting a forest inventory in an area with significant cultural heritage?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ignore cultural sites to focus on tree measurements."},{"id":"b","text":"Prioritize economic potential of the forest over cultural concerns."},{"id":"c","text":"Delegate the task to an external agency."},{"id":"d","text":"Consult with local communities to ensure cultural sensitivity."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01124', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically handle new information that could significantly alter a previously approved forest management plan?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Incorporate the information and update stakeholders accordingly."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore the information to avoid disrupting current plans."},{"id":"c","text":"Delay action until the next scheduled review period."},{"id":"d","text":"Keep the information confidential to maintain authority."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01125', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What ethical obligation does a forester have when collaborating with other professionals in an interdisciplinary project?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Focus on promoting their own expertise over others."},{"id":"b","text":"Ensure transparent communication and respect for all disciplines involved."},{"id":"c","text":"Restrict information sharing to protect departmental interests."},{"id":"d","text":"Delegate responsibilities to other team members to focus on individual tasks."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01126', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'According to professional ethics, how should a forester handle confidential information obtained during community consultations?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Disclose it only to authorized personnel and respect the confidentiality agreement."},{"id":"b","text":"Share it freely with other stakeholders to ensure transparency."},{"id":"c","text":"Use it to gain personal advantages or benefits."},{"id":"d","text":"Ignore it as it is irrelevant to forestry management."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01127', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What ethical consideration should guide a forester when engaging in public advocacy for forest conservation?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritizing personal gain over public interests."},{"id":"b","text":"Ensuring that information shared is accurate and supported by scientific evidence."},{"id":"c","text":"Undermining the credibility of opposing viewpoints regardless of the facts."},{"id":"d","text":"Avoiding any public engagement to prevent conflict."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01128', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'In professional ethics, what is a forester''s responsibility when their personal beliefs conflict with the scientific evidence regarding a forest management practice?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize personal beliefs over scientific evidence."},{"id":"b","text":"Adopt a balanced approach that neither contradicts personal beliefs nor scientific evidence."},{"id":"c","text":"Follow the scientific evidence to ensure responsible decision-making."},{"id":"d","text":"Avoid making any decision to remain neutral."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01129', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically approach the use of local traditional knowledge in forest management?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Disregard traditional knowledge as it is not scientifically validated."},{"id":"b","text":"Incorporate it fully without consulting scientific evidence."},{"id":"c","text":"Respectfully integrate it alongside scientific data, ensuring community consent."},{"id":"d","text":"Use it only if it offers immediate economic benefits."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01130', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is a forester’s ethical obligation when they identify potential environmental harm from a proposed logging operation?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Approve the operation if it brings economic benefits."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore it if the operation is legally sanctioned."},{"id":"c","text":"Advise the logging company in private to avoid public scrutiny."},{"id":"d","text":"Report their concerns to relevant authorities and stakeholders."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01131', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'When participating in community development projects, what ethical guideline should a forester follow to ensure fair participation?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Facilitate the inclusion of diverse community voices and perspectives."},{"id":"b","text":"Encourage the participation of only those community members who agree with the forester''s views."},{"id":"c","text":"Exclude local communities from decision-making processes to expedite project implementation."},{"id":"d","text":"Focus exclusively on the opinions of community leaders."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01132', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What ethical principle should guide a forester when dealing with conflicts between conservation efforts and local livelihoods?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize conservation efforts at all costs."},{"id":"b","text":"Disregard community livelihoods if they interfere with conservation objectives."},{"id":"c","text":"Strike a balance that considers both environmental protection and community needs."},{"id":"d","text":"Enforce strict penalties on communities affecting conservation areas."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01133', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'According to professional ethics, how should a forester address the cultural concerns of indigenous peoples in forest management?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Impose standard management practices without considering cultural differences."},{"id":"b","text":"Consult with indigenous peoples to integrate their cultural perspectives."},{"id":"c","text":"Ignore cultural concerns if they conflict with economic goals."},{"id":"d","text":"Delegate the responsibility to a non-forestry expert."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01134', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is an ethical obligation for a forester when conducting field studies in environmentally sensitive areas?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Focus on collecting data quickly, regardless of environmental impact."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore environmental regulations if they hinder research progress."},{"id":"c","text":"Ensure minimal disturbance to the ecosystem and comply with all environmental regulations."},{"id":"d","text":"Prioritize personal research objectives over environmental considerations."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01135', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically respond if offered a gift by a logging company during a field assessment?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Accept the gift to maintain good relations with the company."},{"id":"b","text":"Accept the gift only if it is of nominal value and report it according to policy."},{"id":"c","text":"Refuse the gift to avoid any perception of bias or conflict of interest."},{"id":"d","text":"Accept the gift and reciprocate with preferential treatment."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01136', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'In professional ethics, what should guide a forester''s conduct when dealing with stakeholders who have conflicting interests?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Maintain impartiality and seek a balanced outcome."},{"id":"b","text":"Prioritize the interests of the most powerful stakeholder."},{"id":"c","text":"Focus solely on economic benefits."},{"id":"d","text":"Adopt the position that offers the most personal gain."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01137', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is the ethical responsibility of a forester when utilizing data from indigenous communities for research purposes?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Utilize it freely without consultation."},{"id":"b","text":"Seek permission and provide credit to the source."},{"id":"c","text":"Sell the information to interested parties."},{"id":"d","text":"Alter the data to fit the desired outcome."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01138', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'When faced with a situation that may harm the forest ecosystem, what is the ethical course of action for a forester?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Proceed without concern, as it''s part of the job."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore it if it complies with current legal standards."},{"id":"c","text":"Document it but take no action."},{"id":"d","text":"Take appropriate action to prevent harm."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01139', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'Under professional ethics, what should a forester prioritize when conducting a community-based forest management project?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ensure the community''s meaningful participation."},{"id":"b","text":"Maximize extraction of forest resources."},{"id":"c","text":"Focus solely on scientific data and ignore community input."},{"id":"d","text":"Promote commercial interests of external investors."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01140', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is the ethical obligation of a forester when they discover a fellow forester violating environmental laws?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Confront the colleague in public."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore it to maintain workplace harmony."},{"id":"c","text":"Report the violation to the appropriate authorities."},{"id":"d","text":"Handle it internally without documentation."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01141', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'In the context of professional ethics, what is a forester''s responsibility when disseminating information about forest conservation?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Only share information that supports their personal views."},{"id":"b","text":"Provide accurate and balanced information to the public."},{"id":"c","text":"Focus on information that benefits their career."},{"id":"d","text":"Avoid sharing any information to prevent misunderstandings."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01142', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically deal with potential corruption when managing government-funded forestry projects?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Report and oppose any corrupt practices."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore it if it does not directly affect them."},{"id":"c","text":"Engage in corrupt practices to expedite processes."},{"id":"d","text":"Participate to ensure personal gain."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01143', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What ethical principle should guide a forester when making decisions about land use changes in protected areas?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize ecological sustainability and legal compliance."},{"id":"b","text":"Maximize economic returns from the area."},{"id":"c","text":"Consider the potential for developing infrastructure."},{"id":"d","text":"Focus solely on the needs of investors."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01144', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'According to professional ethics, how should a forester handle conflicts between traditional practices and modern conservation techniques?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Disregard traditional practices entirely."},{"id":"b","text":"Integrate both approaches for sustainable outcomes."},{"id":"c","text":"Impose modern techniques regardless of community views."},{"id":"d","text":"Prioritize traditional practices without evaluating their impact."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01145', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is the forester''s ethical duty when assessing the impact of forest management practices on local wildlife?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Focus on logging efficiency regardless of wildlife impact."},{"id":"b","text":"Ensure practices do not harm local wildlife populations."},{"id":"c","text":"Prioritize only economically valuable species."},{"id":"d","text":"Leave the assessment to external consultants."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01146', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'Which ethical principle should guide a forester when encountering a conflict of interest during a forest management project?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritizing personal gain"},{"id":"b","text":"Ignoring the conflict"},{"id":"c","text":"Delegating the decision to someone else"},{"id":"d","text":"Transparency and disclosure"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01147', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'In the context of professional ethics, how should a forester approach the integration of indigenous knowledge into forest management plans?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"By incorporating it respectfully and collaboratively"},{"id":"b","text":"By dismissing it as unscientific"},{"id":"c","text":"By using it only if it aligns with personal beliefs"},{"id":"d","text":"By applying it without consulting the community"}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01148', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'According to professional ethics, what is a forester''s responsibility when they find discrepancies in forest management records?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ignore the discrepancies to maintain project timelines"},{"id":"b","text":"Alter the records to fit expected outcomes"},{"id":"c","text":"Discuss the discrepancies only with close colleagues"},{"id":"d","text":"Report the discrepancies to the appropriate authorities"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01149', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically manage conflicts between scientific data and local traditional practices in forest management?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Impose scientific data over local practices"},{"id":"b","text":"Dismiss scientific data in favor of traditional practices"},{"id":"c","text":"Avoid addressing the conflict to prevent tension"},{"id":"d","text":"Facilitate a dialogue to integrate both perspectives"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01150', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'When tasked with evaluating a potential conservation project, what ethical approach should a forester take to ensure community involvement?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Consult only with local government officials"},{"id":"b","text":"Focus solely on scientific assessments"},{"id":"c","text":"Include community members in the decision-making process"},{"id":"d","text":"Rely on external consultants without local input"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01151', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is a forester''s ethical duty when encountering unauthorized land clearing within a protected area?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ignore the activity to maintain local relationships"},{"id":"b","text":"Participate in the land clearing to mitigate impact"},{"id":"c","text":"Document the activity but take no action"},{"id":"d","text":"Report the activity to appropriate authorities"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01152', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'According to professional ethics, how should a forester address the socio-economic concerns of local communities when planning logging activities?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Focus solely on maximizing timber yield"},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore local concerns to expedite the project"},{"id":"c","text":"Rely on corporate interests as the main guide"},{"id":"d","text":"Incorporate community feedback and concerns"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01153', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'In professional ethics, what is a forester''s role when dealing with misinformation about forest conservation practices?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Allow misinformation to spread unchallenged"},{"id":"b","text":"Disregard misinformation as it is not their responsibility"},{"id":"c","text":"Correct misinformation and educate the public"},{"id":"d","text":"Use misinformation to promote personal agendas"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01154', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What ethical obligation does a forester have when they learn of a potentially harmful pesticide being used in forestry operations?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ignore it to avoid conflict with the operation team"},{"id":"b","text":"Promote the continued use of the pesticide"},{"id":"c","text":"Investigate and report the use to the relevant authorities"},{"id":"d","text":"Remove it without any documentation"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01155', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically handle a situation where they suspect a colleague is involved in illegal logging activities?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Report the suspicion to the relevant authorities with documented evidence."},{"id":"b","text":"Confront the colleague directly without any evidence."},{"id":"c","text":"Ignore the situation to avoid conflicts in the workplace."},{"id":"d","text":"Discuss the situation with other colleagues to gather more opinions."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01156', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is the ethical obligation of a forester when developing a forest management plan that impacts indigenous lands?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Focus solely on maximizing timber yield for economic benefits."},{"id":"b","text":"Prioritize government objectives over community concerns."},{"id":"c","text":"Rely exclusively on historical data for decision-making."},{"id":"d","text":"Consult with indigenous communities to incorporate their input and consent."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01157', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'In the context of professional ethics, how should a forester deal with a request from a local politician to expedite an environmental assessment?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Compromise the assessment standards to meet the deadline."},{"id":"b","text":"Seek additional funding to complete the assessment quickly."},{"id":"c","text":"Delegate the task to a junior staff member without proper guidance."},{"id":"d","text":"Politely refuse and adhere to the established assessment procedures."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01158', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What ethical considerations should guide a forester when evaluating the environmental impact of a new road through a forested area?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Consider only the economic benefits of the road."},{"id":"b","text":"Approve the road if requested by a major corporation."},{"id":"c","text":"Conduct a thorough environmental impact assessment involving all stakeholders."},{"id":"d","text":"Focus on minimizing construction costs."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01159', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is a forester''s ethical responsibility when they identify a discrepancy in a forest management report?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ignore it to avoid additional workload."},{"id":"b","text":"Report the discrepancy to their supervisor for further investigation."},{"id":"c","text":"Adjust the data to match expected outcomes."},{"id":"d","text":"Wait until the next audit to address it."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01160', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'According to professional ethics, how should a forester handle stakeholder disagreements during a forest planning session?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Facilitate a discussion to reach a consensus among stakeholders."},{"id":"b","text":"Impose their own solutions regardless of stakeholder input."},{"id":"c","text":"Exclude dissenting opinions to streamline the process."},{"id":"d","text":"Delegate the responsibility to a third-party consultant."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01161', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What should be the ethical approach of a forester when conducting a land use assessment that may lead to the displacement of local communities?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ensure that the assessment includes measures to minimize displacement and provide fair compensation."},{"id":"b","text":"Proceed with the assessment without community consultation."},{"id":"c","text":"Focus only on the technical data and disregard social impacts."},{"id":"d","text":"Prioritize the development goals over community welfare."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01162', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically handle a situation where an influential stakeholder offers a bribe to alter a forest management decision?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Accept the bribe to maintain good relations."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore the offer and continue with the decision-making process."},{"id":"c","text":"Seek advice from colleagues on how to handle the situation."},{"id":"d","text":"Report the incident to the appropriate authorities."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01163', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is the ethical guideline for a forester when presenting research findings to the public?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Present findings accurately and transparently, without bias."},{"id":"b","text":"Emphasize findings that support personal beliefs."},{"id":"c","text":"Alter findings to gain public approval."},{"id":"d","text":"Withhold negative findings to avoid controversy."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01164', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'In professional ethics, what should a forester prioritize when collaborating with indigenous communities on sustainable resource management?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Impose modern techniques without regard for traditional practices."},{"id":"b","text":"Focus only on maximizing resource extraction."},{"id":"c","text":"Recognize and integrate indigenous knowledge and practices."},{"id":"d","text":"Rely solely on scientific data, disregarding local input."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01165', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What ethical principle should guide a forester in ensuring transparency when reporting project outcomes to stakeholders?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Confidentiality"},{"id":"b","text":"Integrity"},{"id":"c","text":"Professionalism"},{"id":"d","text":"Diligence"}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01166', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically approach the resolution of conflicts between conservation goals and the economic needs of a local community?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize conservation above all else"},{"id":"b","text":"Conduct an inclusive stakeholder consultation"},{"id":"c","text":"Ignore economic needs for scientific integrity"},{"id":"d","text":"Rely solely on government directives"}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01167', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'When engaging in a reforestation project, what professional ethical consideration should a forester prioritize to ensure the project''s sustainability?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Maximizing financial profit"},{"id":"b","text":"Using only indigenous species"},{"id":"c","text":"Minimizing initial cost"},{"id":"d","text":"Following political suggestions"}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01168', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is the ethical responsibility of a forester when documenting traditional forest management practices of indigenous communities?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Publish without consent"},{"id":"b","text":"Document only if it benefits research"},{"id":"c","text":"Ensure proper citation and acknowledgment"},{"id":"d","text":"Ignore due to modern practices"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01169', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'How should a forester handle discrepancies in data accuracy when preparing a report on forest health for stakeholders?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Adjust data to fit desired outcomes"},{"id":"b","text":"Report inaccuracies and seek clarification"},{"id":"c","text":"Use data without verification"},{"id":"d","text":"Ignore discrepancies to meet deadlines"}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01170', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'What is the ethical obligation of a forester when evaluating the impact of a proposed development on local biodiversity?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Focus solely on economic benefits"},{"id":"b","text":"Base evaluation on developer''s requirements"},{"id":"c","text":"Ensure comprehensive environmental impact assessment"},{"id":"d","text":"Limit assessment to legally protected species"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01171', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Medium', 'mock',
   'In ensuring public participation in forest management, what ethical guideline should a forester follow to ensure inclusivity?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Invite only industry leaders to consultations"},{"id":"b","text":"Focus on governmental agencies only"},{"id":"c","text":"Seek input from international organizations primarily"},{"id":"d","text":"Involve a diverse range of stakeholders"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01172', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'Which ethical principle should guide a forester in ensuring the accuracy and integrity of data used in forest management reports?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Transparency and accountability"},{"id":"b","text":"Confidentiality of sources"},{"id":"c","text":"Avoiding conflicts of interest"},{"id":"d","text":"Maximizing economic benefits"}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01173', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In the context of professional ethics, what should a forester consider when evaluating the potential impact of introducing non-native species into a forest?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"The economic advantages of non-native species"},{"id":"b","text":"The cultural significance of non-native species"},{"id":"c","text":"The ecological balance and biodiversity"},{"id":"d","text":"The ease of establishing non-native species"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01174', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'What ethical guideline should a forester follow when conducting a consultation process with local communities about a new forestry project?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Limit community input to expedite the process"},{"id":"b","text":"Emphasize technical jargon to assert authority"},{"id":"c","text":"Focus solely on potential economic benefits"},{"id":"d","text":"Ensure inclusive and meaningful participation"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01175', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'When faced with a decision about the allocation of resources for forest conservation, what ethical approach should a forester take to avoid bias?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize projects based on their popularity"},{"id":"b","text":"Use objective criteria and stakeholder consultation"},{"id":"c","text":"Select projects that provide the highest immediate return"},{"id":"d","text":"Base decisions on personal preferences"}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01176', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'Considering professional ethics, how should a forester address the use of indigenous knowledge in scientific research?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Appropriate the knowledge without consent"},{"id":"b","text":"Use the knowledge only if it aligns with scientific data"},{"id":"c","text":"Limit the use of indigenous knowledge due to its non-scientific nature"},{"id":"d","text":"Ensure proper attribution and benefit-sharing"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01177', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'What is the ethical responsibility of a forester in reporting illegal activities discovered during routine forest inspections?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ignore the activities to maintain good relations"},{"id":"b","text":"Report to the appropriate authorities promptly"},{"id":"c","text":"Handle the matter privately without documentation"},{"id":"d","text":"Wait until significant evidence accumulates"}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01178', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In the context of professional ethics, how should a forester manage conflicts between scientific research priorities and community values in forest management?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize scientific research at all costs"},{"id":"b","text":"Disregard community values for scientific progress"},{"id":"c","text":"Delegate the decision to external experts"},{"id":"d","text":"Negotiate a compromise that respects both sides"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01179', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically handle proprietary information when changing employment within the forestry sector?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Share all information with the new employer to gain favor"},{"id":"b","text":"Retain confidentiality of sensitive information"},{"id":"c","text":"Disclose information only if it benefits the new employer"},{"id":"d","text":"Use the information to undermine the previous employer"}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01180', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'What ethical principle should guide a forester when collaborating with NGOs on a forest conservation project?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ensuring the dominance of the forester''s perspective"},{"id":"b","text":"Prioritizing the NGO''s objectives regardless of impact"},{"id":"c","text":"Focusing solely on scientific outcomes"},{"id":"d","text":"Maintaining transparency and mutual respect"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01181', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In professional ethics, what is a forester''s duty when reviewing environmental impact assessments for accuracy?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Review critically and report discrepancies"},{"id":"b","text":"Focus only on positive assessments"},{"id":"c","text":"Approve documents to speed up project approvals"},{"id":"d","text":"Rely solely on the expertise of the assessment authors"}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01182', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'Which ethical principle should guide a forester when faced with the decision to disclose confidential proprietary information to a third party during a collaborative project?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"All information should be shared to ensure transparency."},{"id":"b","text":"Proprietary information can be disclosed if it benefits the collaboration."},{"id":"c","text":"Disclosing confidential information is acceptable if it ensures project success."},{"id":"d","text":"Confidentiality and integrity must be maintained unless there is a legal obligation to disclose."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01183', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'When balancing the ethical duties of a forester to protect biodiversity and respect community development needs, which principle should guide their decision-making process?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Balance both needs by integrating sustainable practices."},{"id":"b","text":"Prioritize community development at all costs."},{"id":"c","text":"Always prioritize biodiversity over community needs."},{"id":"d","text":"Focus solely on legal compliance and disregard ethical considerations."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01184', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In the context of professional ethics, how should a forester approach the integration of traditional ecological knowledge (TEK) when conducting environmental impact assessments (EIA)?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Exclude TEK as it is not scientifically verified."},{"id":"b","text":"Incorporate TEK only if it aligns with existing scientific knowledge."},{"id":"c","text":"Use TEK solely to gain community approval, not in scientific assessments."},{"id":"d","text":"Integrate TEK with scientific data to enhance holistic understanding."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01185', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'What ethical consideration should guide a forester when deciding whether to report an observed legal violation by a local logging company?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Only report if there is personal benefit involved."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore the violation to maintain a good relationship with the company."},{"id":"c","text":"Report the violation to maintain legal and ethical standards."},{"id":"d","text":"Wait for another forester to report the issue."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01186', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'When tasked with incorporating indigenous forestry practices into a modern management plan, what is the ethical obligation of the forester regarding intellectual property rights?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Utilize the practices without mentioning their origin."},{"id":"b","text":"Modify the practices slightly to avoid seeking permission."},{"id":"c","text":"Only use indigenous practices if there is financial compensation involved."},{"id":"d","text":"Acknowledge and seek permission from indigenous communities to use their practices."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01187', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In professional ethics, how should a forester address the challenge of ensuring fair compensation for local communities involved in a government reforestation project?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Negotiate compensation based on market rates alone."},{"id":"b","text":"Ensure that compensation reflects both market rates and the value of traditional knowledge."},{"id":"c","text":"Provide compensation only if the project budget allows."},{"id":"d","text":"Let the government decide the compensation without input from the forester."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01188', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'What ethical principle should guide a forester when presenting sensitive environmental data that could impact public perception of a forestry project?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Emphasize positive data to gain public support."},{"id":"b","text":"Focus on negative data to push for more funding."},{"id":"c","text":"Present all data transparently, ensuring accuracy and impartiality."},{"id":"d","text":"Withhold sensitive data until the project is approved."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01189', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically handle a situation where they suspect that environmental impact assessment data has been manipulated by colleagues to favor project approval?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ignore the suspicion to maintain workplace harmony."},{"id":"b","text":"Confront the colleagues directly in a public meeting."},{"id":"c","text":"Alter the data further to ensure project benefits."},{"id":"d","text":"Investigate and report the manipulation to relevant authorities."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01190', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In the context of professional ethics, what should a forester prioritize when addressing the cultural concerns of indigenous communities during the planning of a logging operation?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Economic benefits to the company should be the primary concern."},{"id":"b","text":"Ensure that cultural concerns are fully integrated into the planning process."},{"id":"c","text":"Cultural concerns should be secondary to technological efficiency."},{"id":"d","text":"Dismiss cultural concerns if they delay project timelines."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01191', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'What ethical guideline should a forester follow when tasked with reviewing and approving research permits for forest studies conducted by external organizations?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Ensure that research proposals meet ethical and scientific standards before approval."},{"id":"b","text":"Approve permits based solely on the potential financial gain for the forest department."},{"id":"c","text":"Approve all permits quickly to avoid bureaucratic delays."},{"id":"d","text":"Reject permits that might reveal negative environmental impacts."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01192', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'What ethical principle should guide a forester when they are confronted with a situation where a community''s traditional use of forest resources conflicts with conservation policies?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize conservation policies to ensure ecological stability."},{"id":"b","text":"Engage in dialogue to harmonize community practices with conservation goals."},{"id":"c","text":"Enforce strict compliance with conservation policies regardless of community impact."},{"id":"d","text":"Delegate decision-making to higher authorities without community input."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01193', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'During the preparation of a community-based forest management plan, what is the ethical consideration a forester should prioritize to ensure the plan''s acceptance by local stakeholders?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Incorporate local knowledge and address community needs and values."},{"id":"b","text":"Ensure the plan maximizes economic returns for the forest industry."},{"id":"c","text":"Focus on achieving national conservation targets above local concerns."},{"id":"d","text":"Rely solely on scientific data without consulting the community."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01194', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'Under professional ethical standards, how should a forester handle a situation where indigenous land rights and forestry development interests are in conflict within a project area?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritize the forestry development interests to boost economic growth."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore indigenous land rights as they are secondary to economic interests."},{"id":"c","text":"Proceed with the project while mitigating adverse effects on indigenous lands."},{"id":"d","text":"Suspend the project until a consensus is reached respecting indigenous rights."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g01195', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In professional ethics, what approach should a forester take when engaging with multiple stakeholders who have conflicting interests in forest land use?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Choose the stakeholder with the most economic influence to support."},{"id":"b","text":"Facilitate open discussions to find a consensus on shared goals."},{"id":"c","text":"Implement the government’s directive regardless of stakeholder input."},{"id":"d","text":"Make decisions based solely on scientific data, excluding stakeholder opinions."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01196', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'What ethical guideline should a forester follow to ensure transparency and accountability when conducting evaluations of forest management practices?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Limit information sharing to internal reports only."},{"id":"b","text":"Provide clear, publicly accessible reports detailing the evaluation findings."},{"id":"c","text":"Focus on positive outcomes to maintain stakeholder support."},{"id":"d","text":"Omit data that could lead to negative perceptions of forest management."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01197', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'What is the ethical responsibility of a forester when encountering discrepancies in carbon stock measurements that could affect international reporting obligations?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Adjust the data to meet international standards and avoid penalties."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore the discrepancies if they are within acceptable limits."},{"id":"c","text":"Report the discrepancies immediately and seek expert validation."},{"id":"d","text":"Consult only with internal team members to resolve the issue."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01198', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In a scenario where a proposed forestry project might infringe on wildlife habitats, what ethical consideration should guide a forester''s decision-making process?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Proceed with the project if it provides substantial economic benefits."},{"id":"b","text":"Rely on historical data to assume minimal impact on wildlife."},{"id":"c","text":"Conduct a thorough environmental impact assessment and consult with wildlife experts."},{"id":"d","text":"Prioritize development goals over potential wildlife concerns."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01199', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'How should a forester ethically approach the inclusion of non-timber forest products (NTFPs) in a community forestry program to ensure equitable benefit sharing?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Develop a benefit-sharing framework that involves all community members."},{"id":"b","text":"Maximize extraction of NTFPs for immediate economic gain."},{"id":"c","text":"Focus on the most economically valuable NTFPs, excluding others."},{"id":"d","text":"Allow unrestricted access to NTFPs for community members only."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g01200', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'What is the ethical obligation of a forester when tasked with implementing a reforestation project in an area with historical land disputes between local communities?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Implement the project strictly according to the government’s plan."},{"id":"b","text":"Avoid involvement in the land dispute and focus solely on planting activities."},{"id":"c","text":"Facilitate conflict resolution discussions before proceeding with the project."},{"id":"d","text":"Prioritize the interests of the community with the most political influence."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g01201', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In addressing the challenge of illegal logging, what ethical principle should guide a forester in their interactions with local enforcement agencies?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Allow enforcement agencies to take the lead without any forester involvement."},{"id":"b","text":"Collaborate with enforcement agencies to ensure effective action against illegal activities."},{"id":"c","text":"Focus on rehabilitation rather than prevention of illegal logging."},{"id":"d","text":"Prioritize economic development over strict enforcement of logging laws."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g01202', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'When a forester is tasked with implementing a community-based forest management agreement (CBFMA) and faces a situation where community leaders are prioritizing immediate economic gain over long-term sustainability, what is the ethical course of action according to professional ethics and values?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Align the management plan strictly with the community leaders'' desires to ensure local support."},{"id":"b","text":"Consult with all community members to assess the broader community''s views and incorporate sustainable practices into the plan."},{"id":"c","text":"Abandon the project if the community leaders do not agree to sustainable practices."},{"id":"d","text":"Focus exclusively on economic gains to meet the short-term needs expressed by the leaders."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
